WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:01,940
I suddenly remembered

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,780
I seem to have some time to leave over there.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,900
Run faster than anyone else

4
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,100
I have the right thing to do

5
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,100
I was worshiping my ancestors during my lifetime.

6
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,180
Zhang Guiying

7
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,180
You did provide for me during your lifetime

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,980
But that is Baojiatang, not Chumatang

9
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,580
Baojiatang's chariot halls are not all for ancestors.

10
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,980
I can draw soul-binding charms to collect scriptures for children

11
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,700
That's Baojiatang

12
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:25,700
I will look for lost items carefully

13
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,740
That's also Baojiatang

14
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,660
My Tang Dan is red

15
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,380
You said it was Baojiatang

16
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,990
you fart

17
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:34,270
I don't fart

18
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,630
Out of the way

19
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:39,100
you can't get in

20
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,020
Thank you General

21
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:43,410
Next time, call me Xiaotie

22
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:46,050
I just saw you talking to the air for half an hour

23
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:48,130
I'm better now This is revenge

24
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:49,730
They came here to torment you because they couldn't find me.

25
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:52,610
I couldn't sleep before. It's almost dawn. I'm going back.
